   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SAMSO Foto Harare</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAMSO Photo Harare</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SAMSO (Southern Africa Media Services) &#xe4;r en NGO baserad i Harare som arbetar med fotojournalistik i s&#xf6;dra Afrika. Syftet med projektet &#xe4;r att utbilda fotografer, b&#xe5;de professionella och amat&#xf6;rer, och att distribuera deras arbeta internationellt. AFRA&apos;s prioriteringsnyckel: 1, n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndig, knfliktf&#xf6;rebyggande/hantering.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAMSO, the southern Africa Media Services, is an NGO based in Harare that works with photojournalism in southern Africa. The purpose of the project is to educate photographers, professionals as well as amateurs, and to distribute their works internationally. Afras prioriteringsnyckel: 1, n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndigt, konfiktf&#xf6;rebyggande/hantering.</narrative>
  </description>
